Z||000000||RiceCooker||06-19-2000||09:17 AM||||Well I was about to turn off last night at my turn but the light was red and a cavalier just pulled up and looked ready to go. I'd take the next turn cause i just had to put this guy in his place. His ricer type exhaust was sticking out the back of his car a good 7 inches - no joke. It actually looked like a piece of plumbing from my toilet painted silver. Anyways he keeps creeping up but the light turns green and i'm gone and that's the last he saw of me - besides my taillights fading off into the night. <BR>Pretty dramatic, eh?||||reg||6
Z||000001||GT Bastard||06-19-2000||01:04 PM||||Damn, you had me on the edge of my seat!  Ahhhh yes, the philisophical implications of fart-can exhausts.  Good kill...||||reg||1
